<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">RRK56.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOSEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ya Kabiri ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA YA KABIRI EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOSEO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Paulo, entumwa ya Kristo Yesu, nk'oku Ruhanga yaayenzire, eyaatumirwe kugamba eby'amagara agaraganisiibwe omuri Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />naakuhandiikira, Timoseo omwana wangye orikukundwa; ninkwendeza embabazi n'okusaasirwa n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Isheboona, na Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwikiriza kw'Omukristaayo okutarimu kubanganisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 24:16">Byak 24:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nsiima Ruhanga ou mpeereza n'omutima ogutarikweshinja, nk'oku baatatenkuru baakozire, ku mba ninkwijuka obutoosha omu kushaba kwangye nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ku nyijuka okurira kwawe, ngira orushusho kukureeba ngu nyijure okushemererwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Byak 16:1</ref>. </char></note> Biinyijutsya okwikiriza kwawe okutarimu buryarya, okwabandize kuba omuri nyokwenkuru Loisi, na nyoko Yunike, na hati nimpamya ngu kuri n'omuriiwe. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:14">1 Tim 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikukwijukiza kwenegyeza ekiconco kya Ruhanga ekiri omuriiwe, eki waahairwe ahabw'okuteebwaho engaro zangye; <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15">Rom 8:15</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ruhanga taratuhaire mutima gw'obwoba, kureka omutima ogw'amaani n'okukunda n'okwerinda.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:16">Rom 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo otarikwatwa enshoni z'okuhamya ebya Mukama waitu, nari okuzigira ahabwangye embohe ye; kureka okwatanise naanye omu kubonabonesibwa ahabw'engiri omu maani ga Ruhanga, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tit 3:5</ref>. </char></note> owaatujunire akatwetesa okweta okurikwera, ti habw'emirimo yaitu, kureka ahabw'eki yaagyendereire, n'ahabw'embabazi ezi yaatuhaire ira ryona omuri Kristo Yesu; <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:14">Heb 2:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi hati ebyo abyorekyeire omu kwija kw'omujuni waitu Kristo Yesu, owaahindwire okufa akakucwa busha, akooreka amagara n'okutafa omu mushana gw'engiri. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Engiri egyo niyo naateereirweho kuba omubuurizi waayo, n'okuba entumwa kandi omwegyesa; <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />kandi ahabwayo ninshaasha, nk'oku ndikushaasha hati; kwonka tindikwitwa nshoni; ahabw'okuba nimmanya ou naikiriize, kandi nimpamiza kimwe ngu naabaasa kurinda <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: eki naamubiikize. </char></note>eki yankwatsize okuhitsya aha kiro ekyo. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Eky'okureeberaho ky'ebigambo by'amazima ebi waahuriire ningamba, okikuratire omu kwikiriza n'okukunda ebiri omuri Kristo Yesu; <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />orinde ekyo kirungi eki waakwatsiibwe Omwoyo Orikwera otuura omuriitwe.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:16">2 Tim 4:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noomanya ku ab'omuri Asia boona bampemukireho; abamwe ahari abo ni Figelo na Herumogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Mukama agirire embabazi ab'omuka ya Onesifooro, ahabw'okuba kaingi akaba angarura omutima omunda; kandi taraitsirwe nshoni ahabw'enjegyere zangye. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ku yaahikire Rooma, yaataho omutima kunsherura, yambona. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Mukama amuhe okusaasirwa omu maisho ge aha kiro ekyo. Kandi noomanya gye ebi yankoreire byona omuri Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Omukristaayo oku ashemereire kwemera oburemeezi omu magara ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Mbwenu nu, mwana wangye, guma ori ow'amaani omu mbabazi eziri omuri Kristo Yesu; <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />kandi ebi waahuriire ningamba omu maisho ga baakareebi baingi, obikwatse abantu abarikwesigwa, abaribaasa kubyegyesa abandi. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:5">2 Tim 4:5</ref>. </char></note> Okwatanise naanye omu kwemera obusaasi nk'omuserukare murungi owa Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Tihariho muserukare oza kurwana, akeetaasya omu mirabanamu ey'amagara aga, ngu asiimwe owaamuhandiikiire obuserukare. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:8">2 Tim 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuzaani orikuhakana omu mpaka taheebwa kirunga kureka yaazaana nk'ebiragiro by'okuzaana oku biri. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:7">1 Kor 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu empingi niwe ashemereire kuba ow'okubanza omu kutogyera ebi ahingire. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ta omutima aha bi ndikugamba; ahakuba Mukama naija kukuha okushoborokyerwa byona.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Guma oijukye Yesu Kristo owaazookire omu bafu, mwijukuru wa Daudi, nk'engiri ei naahairwe oku egamba; <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-14">Fil 1:12-14</ref>. </char></note> niyo ngiri ei barikumbonaboneseza, kandi ei mboheirwe nk'enkozi y'ebibi. Kwonka ekigambo kya Ruhanga kyo tikibohirwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:24">Kol 1:24</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ningumisiririza byona ahabw'abatoorainwe, ngu nabo batungye okujunwa n'ekitiinisa ekitahwaho ebiri omuri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:11">2 Kor 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo eki n'eky'okwesigwa ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Ku turaabe twafiire hamwe nawe, turyaba abahuriire hamwe nawe;<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Ku turigumisiriza, turyayema tutegyekye nawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ku turimwehakana, nawe aryatwehakana;<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu tutamwesiga, We aguma ari omwesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">Ahakuba We tabaasa kuhinduka.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwerinda empaka za busha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ebyo ogume obibaijutsye, noobeehanangiriza omu maisho ga Mukama kwetantara okuhakana aha bigambo okutaine mugasho, kureka okurikugwisa abarikukuhurira. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:6">1 Tim 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Oyezirikye kweyoreka ahari Ruhanga nk'orikusiimwa, omukozi otashemereire kukwatwa nshoni, orikushoboorora gye ekigambo ky'amazima. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Oyetantare okuregyeta okutarimu kutiina Ruhanga, ahakuba nikwongyera kureetera abantu kutamutiina; <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1 Tim 1:20</ref>. </char></note> kandi ebigambo byabo biryarima nk'ekishebe ekirikutana. Omuri abo ni Himenaayo na Fileeto, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />abaateishukire amazima, nibahamya ngu okuzooka kukaheza kuhwaho, bakajuumikirira kimwe okwikiriza kw'abamwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Kub 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:14">Yoh 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omusingi gwa Ruhanga oguhamire guriho, gwine akamanyiso aka ngu, Mukama naamanya abe; kandi ngu, Omuntu weena orikugamba eiziina rya Mukama arugye omu bubi.<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebishemereire omuheereza wa Mukama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Omuri nyaruju tihabamu bintu by'ezaabu n'efeeza byonka, kureka n'eby'ebiti n'eby'eibumba; ebimwe bikoresibwa emirimo y'ekitiinisa, ebindi erikugaywa. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:17">2 Tim 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku arikweshemeza yaayetanisa n'ebyo, aryaba orwabya rw'okukoresa omurimo gw'ekitiinisa, orweziibwe, orutebeekanisiibwe ahabw'omurimo gwona omurungi. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:11">1 Tim 6:11</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo oyetantare okwetenga okubi kw'obutsigazi, okuratire okuhikiirira, okwikiriza, okukunda n'obusingye hamwe na boona abatakira Mukama n'omutima ogushemeire. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Kwonka empaka z'obushema ezitaine buryo ozeetantare, noomanya ku zizaarukwamu okutongana. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:7">Tit 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuhuuku wa Mukama tashemereire kuba entongani, kureka orikutwaza gye ahari boona, orikurahukirwa kwegyesa, orikugumisiriza, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />orikuhana n'obucureezi abarikumuhakanisa, ngu ku kiraabe nikibaasika, Ruhanga abahe okweteisa, bamanyire kimwe amazima, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />basinduukye barugye omu mutego gwa Sitaane, owaabaire abakwatsire, babone kukora ebi Ruhanga akunda.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okusiisikara okuribaho omu biro by'aha mperu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Kwonka omanye eki ngu, omu biro by'aha mperu, haryabaho ebiro by'akabi kaingi, <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:29">Rom 1:29</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba abantu baryaba abarikwekunda, abakunzi b'empiiha, abanyamaryo, abarikwemanya, abarikujumiirana, abarikugomera abazaire baabo, entasiima, abatarikwera, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />abatarikukunda baabo, abatarikwenda kugarukana n'abandi, abarikubeihererana, abatarikweyangisa, enshaarizi, abarikwanga ebirungi, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />abarikureebyana, engangaazi, abarikwekuza, abarikukunda kweshemeza bonka okukira Ruhanga, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mat 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:20">Rom 2:20</ref>. </char></note> abarikuhamya emigyenzo y'ediini, bakahakanisa obushoboorozi bwayo. Abantu nk'abo obeetantare; <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:11">Tit 1:11</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omuri abo harimu abashoobookyera omu maju, bakahamba abakazi abataine mutima, abaremereirwe ebibi, kandi abarikutwarwa okurigira okubi kw'emiringo mingi, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />abeega obutoosha, kwonka batahikye ha kumanyira kimwe amazima. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kur 7:11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 7:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Nka Yane na Yambere oku baahakaniise Musa, nikwo n'abashaija abo bahakanisa amazima; n'abasiisikaire obwengye, abatarikusiimwa omu kwikiriza. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Kwonka tibaribaasa kurengaho, ahakuba obushema bwabo buryareebwa butunu abantu boona, nk'obw'abashaija abo bombi oku bumanyirwe.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugumya Timoseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Kwonka iwe, okakuratira enyegyesa yangye, emitwarize yangye, eki ndikugyenderera, okwikiriza kwangye, okugumisiriza kwangye, okukunda kwangye, okuhamya kwangye, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">Byak 14:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:19">Zab 34:19</ref>. </char></note> n'okuhiigwa n'obusaasi ebyambaireho omuri Antiokea na Ikonio na Lusitura; okuhiigwa kwo nkahiigwa munonga, naagumisiriza; kwonka Mukama waitu yaabinkizamu byona. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat 16:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buzima abamaririire kumara ebiro by'amagara gaabo byona omuri Yesu nibatiina Ruhanga baryahiigwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">1 Tim 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu babi, abarikwegira oku batari, baryayeyongyera kuba babi nibabeihabeiha, kandi nabo nibabeihwabeihwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Kwonka iwe, ogumizemu omu bi waayegire okamanyira kimwe, ahakuba noomanya abaabikwegyeise, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:39">Yoh 5:39</ref>. </char></note> kandi noijuka ngu okuruga omu buto bwawe okamanya Ebyahandiikirwe ebirikwera ebirikubaasa kukuhaisa obwengye bw'okukuhabura omuhanda gw'okujunwa ahabw'okwikiriza Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:19-21">2 Pet 1:19-21</ref>. </char></note> Ebyahandiikirwe byona, ebihandiikisiibwe Omwoyo wa Ruhanga, biine omugasho gw'okwegyesa omuntu, n'okumuhana, n'okumuhabura, n'okumutendeka omu by'okuhikiirira, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />ngu omuntu wa Ruhanga abone kuba ohikire buzima, oine byona ebishemereire omurimo gwona omurungi.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:42">Byak 10:42</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:9">Rom 14:9</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 14:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ninkwehanangiriza omu maisho ga Ruhanga na Kristo, oricwera abahuriire n'abafiire orubanja, kandi ahabw'okugaruka kwe n'obukama bwe, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:20">Byak 20:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 20:31">31</ref>. </char></note> ogume obuurire ekigambo kya Ruhanga, ogambe n'obweziriki omu bunaku oburagiirwe n'obutaragiirwe, ohane, oteise, oyehanangirize n'okugumisiriza kandi n'okwegyesa. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">1 Tim 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ebiro biryaija, obu abantu baryanga kuhurira enyegyesa y'amazima; kwonka ahabw'okugira amatu agarikubarya baryayekanyisiza abeegyesa abarikwegyesa nk'okwetenga kwabo oku kuri, <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:11">2 Tes 2:11</ref>. </char></note> beigare amatu ngu batahurira amazima, bahabe, bakuratire ebiteekyerezo by'ebigunjano. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Kwonka iwe, oyerinde omuri byona, ogumisiririze obusaasi, okore omurimo gw'omubuurizi w'engiri, ohikize kimwe okuheereza kwawe.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugamba aha kufa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:17">Fil 2:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba na mbwenu nyowe ndi haihi kutambwa nk'empongano y'eby'okunywa eshukwa aha itambiro, kandi obunaku bwangye bw'okuruga omu nsi bwiriire haihi. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:12">1 Tim 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:14">Fil 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Ndwaine okurwana okurungi, mperize orugyendo rwangye, ndinzire okwikiriza. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:4">1 Pet 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Ekitsigaire mbiikiirwe ekirunga ky'okuhikiiriwra, eki Mukama omucwi w'emanja ohikiriire arimpa aha kiro ekyo, kandi tiinye nyenka, kureka na boona abarikukunda okugaruka kwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Oteereho, nk'oku orikubaasa, kwija kundeeba juba; <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Deema, ahabw'okukunda eby'ensi eby'ebiro ebi, akantsigaho, yaataaha Tesalonika; Kreskeene yaaza Galatia, na Tito yaaza Dalumatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka wenka niwe ntsigaire nawe. Reeba Mako, mwijane; ahakuba nangasira munonga omu kuheereza. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21">Efe 6:21</ref>. </char></note> Tukiko nkamutuma Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Omu kwija ondeetere eky'okwefubika eki naatsigire Troa owa Kaapo, n'ebitabo, kandi okukira munonga oreete eby'empu. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1 Tim 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 3:39">2 Sam 3:39</ref>. </char></note> Alegizanda omuheesi w'emiringa akankora kubi munonga; Mukama waitu aryamwihura ebi yaakozire. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Naiwe omwerinde; ahakuba akarwanisa munonga ebigambo byaitu. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Omu kwetonganira kwangye okw'okubanza tihaine waanyemereireho, boona bakantsigaho. Ninshaba ngu batarikiturwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:21-28">Dan 6:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:11">Byak 23:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mukama waitu akanyemerera haihi, yangumya, ngu mbone kugambira kimwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga, Abanyamahanga boona bakihurire. Kandi nkashahurwa omu kanwa k'entare. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Mukama waitu aryaguma ankize omu kabi koona, anjune okuhitsya obu nditaaha omu bukama bwe bw'omu iguru. Aheebwe ekitiinisa ebiro byona. Amiina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ondamukize Priska na Akula kandi n'ab'omu ka ya Onesifooro. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasto akaguma Korinso; kandi Trofimo nkamutsiga Mileeto arwaire. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Oteho omutima munonga, oije ebiro by'embeho bitakahikire. Yubulo, Pudenti, Liino, Kulaudio n'ab'eishe-emwe boona baabaramutsya. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Mukama agume n'omwoyo gwawe. Embabazi zibe naimwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>